*  FALSE REJECT: ARBNO left element then a BARE alternation carrying the recursive defer. FENCE(...) instead of the bare ALT is GREEN. Controls 'a'/SPAN/ARB left elements are all GREEN.
          E = ARBNO('a') ('+' *E | '')
          'a+a+a' POS(0) *E RPOS(0)            :S(OK)F(NO)
OK        OUTPUT = 'match'                      :(END)
NO        OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
